data/liara-docs/
# data/index/ IS tracked: a Vercel build is a git checkout, and without the
# index in it loadIndex() throws on every request and /api/health returns 503.
# Building it during `next build` instead would need network to github.com and
# to the embeddings provider, and would put ~14 minutes of embedding on the
# critical path of every deploy. Shipping the artifact makes deploys fast and
# byte-for-byte reproducible.
# The one file NOT shipped is the incremental build cache:
data/index/embeddings.json
data/cache/
data/runtime/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
.playwright-cli/
.cache/
.vercel

